Bind Npc 31564 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31563 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 651 "Dispatch to Eslant"
    Journal for karus "You must deliver recommendation letter to [Trader] Drill."
    Journal for elmorad "You must deliver recommendation letter to [Trader] Ellon."
    Collect 1 of 900191000

Requires player level >= 64 and quest 650 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    Say "Somebody's looking us from Islant. Go to him at once."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "How do you ...and who are you?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You are recommended by the captain? Hmmm...I guess you've got some skills.\n\nThe Eslant updated traders must be passed to the [Captain recommendation to drill."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "How do you ...and who are you?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You are recommended by the captain? Hmmm...I guess you've got some skills.\n\nEslant [updated] Ellen traders to Captain recommendation must be passed."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "By the way, where's the [Captain Recommendation]? [Sailor] Armada? That clumsy fool must have forgotten to give it to you. Please come back with it."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "By the way, where's the [Captain Recommendation]? [Sailor] Kidd? That clumsy fool must have forgotten to give it to you. Please come back with it."

On claimable
    Show quest "Hmm, this looks like it. Well, then I will officially ask you to help us with our mission here.\n\nGood. But first, I need to ask you something urgently."

On completed
    Say "You need more training. See you when you reach Lv65."
